WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
(upbeat music)

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.290
(brand sizzles)

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:04.498
- Here's a quick tip from someone we love.

00:00:04.498 --> 00:00:06.870
- Hey, Drew, here is a design tip.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:09.280
If you're stuck on how you
want your place to look,

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.470
think instead about how
you want it to feel.

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.750
Do you want your home office to be a place

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.260
that feels inspiring,

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:19.130
or your bedroom to be a
place that feels sexy?

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:22.540
Maybe you want your living
room to feel super relaxed.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.140
So close your eyes,

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.770
and transport yourself to the
last time you felt that way.

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:29.770
The last time I felt truly relaxed,

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:31.020
I was at the beach.

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:34.060
So I'm gonna pull in
those beautiful blues,

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:35.620
those sandy hues.

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:39.170
I'm gonna bring in drift
woods and washed linen.

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:41.450
And I'm gonna take cues from that place

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:42.770
where I felt relaxed

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:45.320
to design a relaxed space in my home.

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:47.680
So let the feeling guide you.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.256
- That's genius.

00:00:49.256 --> 00:00:51.272
Why didn't I think of that?

00:00:51.272 --> 00:00:53.939
(upbeat music)

